# Supabase — identity & access.
#
# Leave these unset to run the prototype exactly as before: the role picker at
# /roles drives everything and no network calls are made. Set them and identity
# becomes real — sessions come from Supabase Auth and roles from public.profiles,
# enforced by RLS.
#
# Project: jaz-chocolate (ap-south-1), ref mjfocpdkemoxhclmdaqk
# Values below are the live project's. The publishable key is meant to ship in
# the browser bundle; RLS is what protects the data, not the key. NEVER put a
# service_role key in a VITE_* variable — it bypasses RLS entirely.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://mjfocpdkemoxhclmdaqk.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_IDM3V9kwoFgSjyLaHcQS-w_T9CKFkGf
